# Cloudflare Pages redirects file.
#
# Preserves the original .html URLs (links shared externally, bookmarks,
# search-engine indices) after the site reorg into /wordpress/* and
# /changelog/. Every old URL 301s to its new home so nothing breaks.
#
# Syntax: <from>  <to>  <status>
# 301 = permanent. Search engines update their index to the new URL.

# WordPress platform — primary pages
/components.html      /wordpress/components/   301
/components           /wordpress/components/   301
/layouts.html         /wordpress/layouts/      301
/layouts              /wordpress/layouts/      301
/docs.html            /wordpress/docs/         301
/docs                 /wordpress/docs/         301

# Changelog
/changelog.html       /changelog/              301
